WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.919 --> 00:00:05.505
I see the glint in your eyes, you junkies!

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:09.509
Oh, what will I do with you all?

00:00:09.592 --> 00:00:11.761
Here now, here's the good stuff.

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:13.513
I can't bear it…

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:18.643
I can't help myself!

00:00:20.645 --> 00:00:23.773
Um, Boss Lady, you'll startle our felines.

